# The Tilt/Minikube dev cluster. The Tiltfile builds these images with the repo
# root as the context, and Tilt reads this file to decide what it watches — so
# without these rules, editing a manifest or the Tiltfile itself would rebuild
# every live-edited image.
Tiltfile
dev
**/dist
docker
docs
**/node_modules
# Rust build output. Sending a crate's target/ into the build context would be
# gigabytes and would invalidate the context on every local cargo run; the
# images build both crates from source in their own stages.
**/target
.git
.github
